#: ../../library/math.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`math` --- mathematical functions"
msgstr ":mod:`math` --- matematičke funkcije"

#: ../../library/math.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``math`` module provides some basic mathematical functions for working "
"with floating-point numbers."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``math`` pruža neke osnovne matematičke funkcije za rad s brojevima s "
"pomičnim zarezom."

#: ../../library/math.rst:10
msgid ""
"*Note:* On the OpenMV Cam, floating-point numbers have 32-bit precision."
msgstr ""
"*Napomena:* Na OpenMV Cam, brojevi s pomičnim zarezom imaju 32-bitnu "
"preciznost."

#: ../../library/math.rst:13
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Funkcije"

#: ../../library/math.rst:17
msgid "Return the inverse cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća inverzni kosinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:21
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća inverzni hiperbolni kosinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:25
msgid "Return the inverse sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća inverzni sinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:29
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća inverzni hiperbolni sinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:33
msgid "Return the inverse tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća inverzni tangens od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:37
msgid "Return the principal value of the inverse tangent of ``y/x``."
msgstr "Vraća glavnu vrijednost inverznog tangensa od ``y/x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:41
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća inverzni hiperbolni tangens od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:45
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards positive infinity."
msgstr "Vraća cijeli broj, ``x`` zaokružen prema pozitivnoj beskonačnosti."

#: ../../library/math.rst:49
msgid "Return ``x`` with the sign of ``y``."
msgstr "Vraća ``x`` s predznakom od ``y``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:53
msgid "Return the cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća kosinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:57
msgid "Return the hyperbolic cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća hiperbolni kosinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:61
msgid "Return radians ``x`` converted to degrees."
msgstr "Vraća radijane ``x`` pretvorene u stupnjeve."

#: ../../library/math.rst:65
msgid "Return the error function of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća funkciju pogreške od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:69
msgid "Return the complementary error function of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća komplementarnu funkciju pogreške od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:73
msgid "Return the exponential of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća eksponencijalnu vrijednost od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:77
msgid "Return ``exp(x) - 1``."
msgstr "Vraća ``exp(x) - 1``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:81
msgid "Return the absolute value of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća apsolutnu vrijednost od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:85
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards negative infinity."
msgstr "Vraća cijeli broj, ``x`` zaokružen prema negativnoj beskonačnosti."

#: ../../library/math.rst:89
msgid "Return the remainder of ``x/y``."
msgstr "Vraća ostatak od ``x/y``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:93
msgid ""
"Decomposes a floating-point number into its mantissa and exponent. The "
"returned value is the tuple ``(m, e)`` such that ``x == m * 2**e`` exactly."
"  If ``x == 0`` then the function returns ``(0.0, 0)``, otherwise the "
"relation ``0.5 <= abs(m) < 1`` holds."
msgstr ""
"Rastavlja broj s pomičnim zarezom na njegovu mantisu i eksponent. Vraćena "
"vrijednost je n-torka ``(m, e)`` takva da je ``x == m * 2**e`` točno.  Ako "
"je ``x == 0`` tada funkcija vraća ``(0.0, 0)``\\ , inače vrijedi odnos ``0.5"
" <= abs(m) < 1``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:100
msgid "Return the gamma function of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća gama funkciju od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:104
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is finite."
msgstr "Vraća ``True`` ako je ``x`` konačan."

#: ../../library/math.rst:108
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is infinite."
msgstr "Vraća ``True`` ako je ``x`` beskonačan."

#: ../../library/math.rst:112
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is not-a-number"
msgstr "Vraća ``True`` ako ``x`` nije broj"

#: ../../library/math.rst:116
msgid "Return ``x * (2**exp)``."
msgstr "Vraća ``x * (2**exp)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:120
msgid "Return the natural logarithm of the gamma function of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća prirodni logaritam gama funkcije od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:124
msgid "With one argument, return the natural logarithm of *x*."
msgstr "S jednim argumentom vraća prirodni logaritam od *x*\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:126
msgid "With two arguments, return the logarithm of *x* to the given *base*."
msgstr "S dva argumenta vraća logaritam od *x* za zadanu *base*\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:130
msgid "Return the base-10 logarithm of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća logaritam po bazi 10 od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:134
msgid "Return the base-2 logarithm of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća logaritam po bazi 2 od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:138
msgid ""
"Return a tuple of two floats, being the fractional and integral parts of "
"``x``.  Both return values have the same sign as ``x``."
msgstr ""
"Vraća n-torku od dva broja s pomičnim zarezom, koji su razlomljeni i "
"cjelobrojni dio od ``x``\\ .  Obje vraćene vrijednosti imaju isti predznak "
"kao ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:143
msgid "Returns ``x`` to the power of ``y``."
msgstr "Vraća ``x`` na potenciju ``y``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:147
msgid "Return degrees ``x`` converted to radians."
msgstr "Vraća stupnjeve ``x`` pretvorene u radijane."

#: ../../library/math.rst:151
msgid "Return the sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća sinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:155
msgid "Return the hyperbolic sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća hiperbolni sinus od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:159
msgid "Return the square root of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća kvadratni korijen od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:163
msgid "Return the tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća tangens od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:167
msgid "Return the hyperbolic tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Vraća hiperbolni tangens od ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:171
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards 0."
msgstr "Vraća cijeli broj, ``x`` zaokružen prema 0."

#: ../../library/math.rst:174
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Konstante"

#: ../../library/math.rst:179
msgid "Base of the natural logarithm."
msgstr "Baza prirodnog logaritma."

#: ../../library/math.rst:184
msgid "The ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter."
msgstr "Omjer opsega kruga i njegovog promjera."
